# Keep the deployed bundle small: exclude training assets, docs and large
# reference documents that the running app never reads at request time.
# Do NOT list models/, static/ or templates/ here -- the app needs them.
# samples/ is deliberately NOT listed: app.py reads from it at request time
# (the "residential"/"commercial" preset samples in /api/analyze).
training/
docs/
tests/
*.pdf
*.pptx
*.docx
